      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着她便开口倾诉。\n她讲述了一个有关英雄与贤者的故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "806eb7815ea5da33f34fc6ce684ca300308af413551cf863db43d20d7ad9a365",
