      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……贤者说了，\n他希望自己永远都是英雄的守护者与理解者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3966d63e3171f921d7b5cadb70d42cd41587e68e72bb272650eb95fd5a6c66b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
