      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而英雄也用行动对贤者表达感谢。\n他将镶在自己剑上的宝石送给对方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47f2ac90335e50f7faa64aff9ebc05fcd755561639933bc6f110760d1448e7f8",
